  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 and .NET 11; removes .NET 8 support. Removes CreateDefault, CreateExpanded and CreateCompatible factories; use CreatePack, CreateFocusedTools or CreateBatchTool. Request and snapshot DTOs use named properties. Batch binding rejects invalid null object members without recovery. Preserves XML encodings and field-run style edits.",
